      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Do not take Advil or any ibuprofen-based medication while pregnant as it can harm both you and the baby's developing brain and fluids. Since you are six weeks pregnant, you should contact your obstetrician or pharmacist immediately before taking any pain reliever, as they can recommend a safe alternative like acetaminophen. Please prioritize your health by seeking professional medical advice right away before trying to force yourself to work through the pain.",
